{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"41000122254","bookName":"La chica que conquistó al magnate","cover":"","viewCount":2278401,"followCount":40509,"introduction":"De niño, Darío Fernández no era aplicado; su madre recurrió a Daniela Noriega como su pequeña tutora. Admirando sus virtudes, Darío se volvió disciplinado y prometió casarse con ella. Tras convertirse en adulto, Darío se convirtió en una figura poderosa en el mundo de los negocios, escalando posiciones hasta llegar a ser el hombre más rico del mundo. Su primera acción tras alcanzar el éxito y la fama fue regresar al campo para cumplir su promesa: desposar a Daniela.","chapterCount":87,"labels":["Hidden Identity","Childhood Sweetheart"],"tags":["Hidden Identity","Childhood Sweetheart"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"La-chica-que-conquistó-al-magnate","bookNameLower":"la-chica-que-conquistó-al-magnate","shelfTime":"2025-09-30 18:54:20","firstShelfTime":"2025-09-30 18:54:20","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"601563494","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":188275,"price":0},{"id":"601563495","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":132766,"price":0},{"id":"601563496","index":2,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":119475,"price":0},{"id":"601563497","index":3,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":144307,"price":0},{"id":"601563498","index":4,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":103561,"price":0},{"id":"601563500","index":5,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":89481,"price":0},{"id":"601563501","index":6,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":101257,"price":0},{"id":"601563502","index":7,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":141363,"price":0},{"id":"601563503","index":8,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":159966,"price":0},{"id":"601563504","index":9,"unlock":tru